'''Santa's Magic''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by completing [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Christmas_Event_2019?so=search#Santa.27s_Challenge Saint Nikilis’ Challenge] during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable by trading as the event has since ended. 

== Appearance ==
Santa’s Magic has a crimson red blade with a holly red edge, along with a dark taped, gradient-like handle. The guard is black.

== Trivia  ==
* You had to unbox/trade for 10 knives to trade in for this knife, differing from any Christmas Event before.

